<title>UK: Merrill Lynch sets warrants on ENDESA.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets warrants on ENDESA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co CV has issued 250,000 American-style call warrants, on Empresa Nacional de Electricidad SA x, lead manager Merrill Lynch International said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    10,000.00 ESP	   PREMIUM	11.06 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1,140.00 ESP	    GEARING	8.79 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   14.JAN.98		 PAYDATE	03.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LONDON		    MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  10,030.00 ESP</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
